===== Information for Users ("READ-ME") ================

Welcome to Hugo for Windows!

This is the first game in a series of three cartoon-style puzzle-solving
graphics adventures for Windows 3.1, Windows 95 or later.  Starring
Hugo and Penelope, the three games are set in a haunted house, a whodunit
mystery and a menacing jungle.  Includes a simple point & click interface
(plus an optional command line interface), online help with hints, MIDI
music and digital sound effects (with sound card).


